<title>UK: SBC warrants on Fresenius Medical Care.</title>
<headline>SBC warrants on Fresenius Medical Care.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp (Deutschland) says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Fresenius Medical Care.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 23.OCT.96-20.JAN.98   PAYDATE	22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  124.60 DEM</p>
<p> WARRANTS     STRIKE	 ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 110.00 DEM   29.74 DEM     12.20 PCT    4.20 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	 130.00 DEM   20.05 DEM     20.40 PCT    6.20 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
